#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:5
#: 238b7361cd2b4bf493b8aeff054eff8d
msgid "Motor Thrust Scaling"
msgstr "电机推力缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:7
#: d764736410ab48f391f016ba1174a087
msgid ""
"Copter includes *motor thrust scaling* which compensates for the non-linear "
"thrust output of most ESCs and motors."
msgstr "Copter 包含*电机推力缩放*功能，用于补偿大多数 ESC 和电机的非线性推力输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:12
#: 15f16c0b18ce4c899d3323f7bac3f449
msgid ""
"The default curve should work for nearly all ESC/motor combinations. "
"Normally the parameters should not be adjusted unless the vehicle’s actual "
"thrust curve has been measured."
msgstr "默认曲线应适用于几乎所有 ESC/电机组合。通常情况下，除非已测量了飞行器的实际推力曲线，否则不应调整这些参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:17
#: a158a14669db4db2845b0f58e9110dc7
msgid "Thrust Curves"
msgstr "推力曲线"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:19
#: 7e4fa0b5cf9f490ca719803012115717
msgid "The curve is controlled by two parameters:"
msgstr "该曲线由两个参数控制："

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:21
#: f4264b36183546bf8c7d1e8663926ca1
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO<MOT_THST_EXPO>` controls the shape of the thrust curve "
"with \"0\" meaning a completely linear curve and \"1.0\" being very curved "
"(see pictures below).  The default is \"0.65\" (the image below incorrectly "
"states the default is 0.5)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_THST_EXPO<MOT_THST_EXPO>` "
"控制推力曲线的形状，「0」表示完全线性曲线，「1.0」表示曲线非常弯曲（见下图）。默认值为「0.65」（下图中错误地标注默认值为 0.5）。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:26
#: 78819570b260480c8b6496385903ac55
msgid ""
"Some ESCs have built-in linearizing curves and the default EXPO value of "
"\"0.65\" will cause stability issues, requiring thrust stand measurements to"
" adjust the EXPO. Typically, values of \"0\" to \"0.2\" will result."
msgstr ""
"部分 ESC 内置了线性化曲线，默认 EXPO 值「0.65」会导致稳定性问题，需要通过推力台测量来调整 EXPO。通常结果值在「0」到「0.2」之间。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:31
#: 90b8c8d076fd43e48787343aa3165acc
#, python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX<MOT_SPIN_MAX>` controls the point at which the thrust "
"flattens out near its maximum.  By default this is 0.95 meaning 95% of full "
"throttle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX<MOT_SPIN_MAX>` 控制推力在接近最大值时趋于平稳的点。默认值为 0.95，即 95% 的满油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:36
#: 469b23194d6744e5a90d03d25fb91775
msgid "Thrust Stands"
msgstr "推力台"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:38
#: 0252d40ccb6646f7a777dfddf68d94d5
msgid ""
"The thrust stands listed below can be used to measure the PWM signal vs "
"thrust output for a vehicle's specific motor, esc and battery. Be sure to "
"use the ESCs rated input PWM range when measuring these values."
msgstr "以下列出的推力台可用于测量特定电机、ESC 和电池组合的 PWM 信号与推力输出关系。测量时请确保使用 ESC 额定输入 PWM 范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:40
#: defe3afe2d454c65bb855055a5b17587
msgid ""
"`RCbenchmark.com thrust stands "
"<https://www.rcbenchmark.com/pages/series-1580-thrust-stand-dynamometer>`__"
msgstr ""
"`RCbenchmark.com 推力台 <https://www.rcbenchmark.com/pages/series-1580-thrust-"
"stand-dynamometer>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:41
#: b9ef32dcd1b84b3ea9ce181f892d26e1
msgid ""
"`Turnigy thrust stand <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-thrust-stand-and-"
"power-analyser-v3.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Turnigy 推力台 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-thrust-stand-and-power-"
"analyser-v3.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:44
#: fe52e47981744abe8c8feafe78c81bd6
msgid "Parameter Calculation"
msgstr "参数计算"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:46
#: 6d3197db55924b1bab5f08fc0672f9a8
msgid ""
"A copy of `this spreadsheet "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_75aZqiT_K1CdduhUe4-DjRgx3Alun4p8V2pt6vM5P8/edit#gid=0>`__"
" can be used to calculate the appropriate values from the thrust stand data "
"above."
msgstr ""
"可使用`此电子表格 "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_75aZqiT_K1CdduhUe4-DjRgx3Alun4p8V2pt6vM5P8/edit#gid=0>`__的副本，根据上述推力台数据计算合适的参数值。"
